        <h2>Payment Successful ✅</h2>

        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

        <p>Your payment has been <strong>processed successfully</strong>. Here are the payment details:</p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <strong>Payment #{{paymentId}}</strong>
        </div>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Amount Paid:</th>
                <td>₹{{amount}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Rental Order:</th>
                <td>#{{rentalNumber}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Date:</th>
                <td>{{date}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p>Your rental continues as per the agreed schedule. You can view your payment history anytime from your dashboard.</p>

        <p>Thank you for choosing RentEase!</p>

        <p>Happy Renting,<br>The RentEase Team</p>
